ks and 3 monitors ($1,554). This keeps the single-PO requirement, but the upstream error could recur.\n3. **Hold:** leave PO0001 as is and investigate the fulfilment error with the supplier first.\n\nAlso, I shipped to \"HQ\" as written. If HQ needs a specific street address, send it and I'll use that for the next order.", "type": "text"}]}]}